                 cnt = mod.add(cnt, mod.mul(tmp[j], pairs));\n            }\n            ans = mod.add(ans, mod.mul(cnt, i == 0 ? 1 : fact[i - 1]));\n            for (int j = mid - lim; j <= mid + lim; j++) {\n                for (int cur = -c; cur <= c; cur++) {\n                    int pairs = c - Math.abs(cur) + 1;\n                    dp[j + cur] = mod.add(dp[j + cur], mod.mul(pairs, tmp[j]));\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        out.println(ans);\n        out.close();\n    }\n\n    static class InputReader {\n        private InputStream stream;\n        private byte[] buf = new byte[1024];\n        private int curChar, numChars;\n        InputReader(InputStream s) { stream = s; }\n        private int read() throws IOException {\n            if (numChars == -1) throw new IOException();\n            if (curChar >= numChars) {\n                curChar = 0;\n                numChars = stream.read(buf);\n                if (numChars <= 0) return -1;\n            }\n            return buf[curChar++];\n        }\n        public int nextInt() throws IOException {\n            int c = read();\n            while (c <= 32) c = read();\n            int sgn = 1;\n            if (c == '-') { sgn = -1; c = read(); }\n            int res = 0;\n            while (c >= '0' && c <= '9') {\n                res = res * 10 + (c - '0');\n                c = read();\n            }\n            return res * sgn;\n        }\n    }\n\n    static class OutputWriter {\n        private PrintWriter pw;\n        OutputWriter(OutputStream os) { pw = new PrintWriter(os, true); }\n        public void println(Object o) { pw.println(o); }\n        public void close() { pw.close(); }\n    }\n\n    static class ModInt {\n        int mod;\n        ModInt(int m) { mod = m; }\n        int add(int a, int b) { a += b; if (a >= mod) a -= mod; return a; }\n        int mul(int a, int b) { return (int)((a * 1L * b) % mod); }\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "log